            "prompt": {
              "type": "string",
              "label": "Cinematic Visual Template",
              "value": "Dramatic low-angle hero framing looking up at the presenter as he cycles hard on a stationary bike. Warm practical rim light catches the edge of his shoulder and the bike frame; a cool blue key light carves across his face; deep shadow falls into the background. The setting is a dark, restrained, realistic biological/medical data-visualization environment \u2014 glowing blue and red data lines and translucent anatomical or genetic imagery relevant to the subject drift around him. Shallow depth of field, rich cinematic color grade, a strong sense of scale and gravity in the environment. A slow, dramatic push-in on his face at the emotional peak of the line. He is visibly and audibly out of breath, sweating, cycling hard, speaking in short strained clauses with real gasping breath sounds at the marked breath-beat points \u2014 never smooth or produced narrator delivery. Match the presenter's exact likeness, build, and cycling motion to the reference footage.",
